# Diagnostic snapshots are timestamped, so ad-hoc re-runs (e.g. to confirm 0 stale after a fix)
# don't clutter git. The evidence snapshot for a specific run is committed deliberately with
# `git add -f` (see analysis/Readme.md) — once tracked, git keeps it regardless of this ignore.
regeneration_diff_*.txt
regeneration_diff_*.html
stale_correlations_*.csv
rank_comparison_*.html
rank_comparison_*.csv
review_old_vs_new_*.html
review_pdf_old_*/
pdf_compare_*.html
